 * 00     3f    0000   00    0c       0f    02  01050202000200ff00ff0000 | SET LED MATRIX Effect (VARSTR, Backlight, Breathing 0x02, Colours 0x02, ? 0x00, Colours 0x02, RGB 0x00FF00, RGB 0xFF0000)
